    why: "The systematic review (Anestis 2014) found the trials methodologically too weak to support efficacy claims; horses are genuinely engaging, which is exactly what makes uncontrolled studies glow.",
    source: "Anestis et al. (2014), Journal of Clinical Psychology.",
